    "text": "The Philippine one hundred-peso note (Filipino: \"Sandaang Piso\") (₱100) is a denomination of Philippine currency. Philippine president Manuel A. Roxas is currently featured on the front side of the bill, while the Mayon Volcano and the whale shark (locally known as \"butanding\") are featured on the reverse side.",
